    "short_description": "Query and replay events that have flowed through a pipeline via the v3 REST API.",
    "body": "<h1>Events endpoint {{ds:component/chip|label=v3|variant=success}}</h1>
<p style="margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);"><strong>Stability:</strong> {{ds:component/chip|label=Stable|variant=success}}</p>

<p>Query and replay <a href="{{cms:item/6277e4fb-3e99-45b0-a7f6-aefe69c5778f}}">events</a> that have flowed through <a href="{{cms:item/3d70c0d4-fed2-4923-a9ee-8087cde0dea4}}">pipelines</a>. Base URL: <code>https://api.godzilladocs.dev/v3</code>.</p>

<p><strong>v3 is the current API version.</strong> The v2 events endpoint has been withdrawn. If you're still on v2, see the <a href="{{cms:item/abc5d1d5-7a3e-42a6-a212-cca0c12ac279}}">v2→v3 migration guide</a> to upgrade.</p>

<h2 id=query>Query events</h2>
<p><code>GET /v3/pipelines/{pipeline_id}/events</code> — cursor-paginated event search with optional filtering by timestamp and status.</p>

<p><strong>Query parameters:</strong></p>
{{ds:component/parameter-table|rows_html=<tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Filter by <code>success</code>, <code>failed</code>, or <code>pending</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>since</code></td><td>ISO 8601 timestamp</td><td>No</td><td>Events after this timestamp.</td></tr><tr><td><code>until</code></td><td>ISO 8601 timestamp</td><td>No</td><td>Events before this timestamp.</td></tr><tr><td><code>page_size</code></td><td>integer</td><td>No</td><td>1–100, defaults to 20.</td></tr><tr><td><code>cursor</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Opaque pagination cursor from a previous response's <code>next_cursor</code>.</td></tr>}}

<p><strong>Response:</strong></p>
{{ds:component/code-block|filename=response.json|language=json|code={
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "evt_8f2c1a90",
      "type": "order.created",
      "status": "success",
      "occurred_at": "2026-08-18T09:12:44Z",
      "payload": { "order_id": "ord_4471" }
    }
  ],
  "next_cursor": "eyJvZmZzZXQiOjIwfQ"
}}}

<h2 id=replay>Replay an event</h2>
<p><code>POST /v3/pipelines/{pipeline_id}/events/{event_id}/replay</code> — reprocess a single event through the pipeline from scratch.</p>

{{ds:component/docs-toc|items_html=<li><a href=#query>Query events</a></li><li><a href=#replay>Replay an event</a></li>}}",
